:"sparrow"}],"gloss":"sparrow"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"முன்றில்","lemma":"muṉṟil","gloss":"courtyard"}],"gloss":"in the courtyard"},{"surface":"உணங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"உணங்கல்","lemma":"uṇaṅkal","gloss":"drying grain"}],"gloss":"drying grain"},{"surface":"மாந்தி","parts":[{"text":"மாந்து","lemma":"māntu","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having eaten"},{"surface":"மன்றத்து","parts":[{"text":"மன்றத்து","lemma":"மன்றத்து","gloss":"of the public ground"}],"gloss":"of the public ground","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எருவினுண்","parts":[{"text":"எருவினுண்","lemma":"எருவினுண்","gloss":"inside the manure"}],"gloss":"inside the manure","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாது","parts":[{"text":"தாது","lemma":"tātu","gloss":"fine dust"}],"gloss":"fine dust"},{"surface":"குடைவன","parts":[{"text":"குடைவன","lemma":"kuṭai","gloss":"scooping"}],"gloss":"scooping"},{"surface":"ஆடி","parts":[{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"āṭu","gloss":"play"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having played"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இல்லிறைப்","parts":[{"text":"இல்லிறைப்","lemma":"இல்லிறைப்","gloss":"under the house eaves"}],"gloss":"under the house eaves","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பள்ளித்தம்","parts":[{"text":"பள்ளி","lemma":"paḷḷi","gloss":"resting place"},{"text":"தம்","lemma":"tam","gloss":"their"}],"gloss":"their resting place"},{"surface":"பிள்ளையொடு","parts":[{"text":"பிள்ளை","lemma":"piḷḷai","gloss":"chicks"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with their chicks"},{"surface":"வதியும்","parts":[{"text":"வதி","lemma":"vati","gloss":"dwell"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual future suffix"}],"gloss":"dwells"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புன்கண்","parts":[{"text":"புன்கண்","lemma":"புன்கண்","gloss":"sorrowful"}],"gloss":"sorrowful","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாலையும்","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"mālai","gloss":"evening"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the evening"},{"surface":"புலம்பும்","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"pulampu","gloss":"loneliness"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual future suffix"}],"gloss":"and the loneliness"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்றுகொல்","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"today"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"is it today?"},{"surface":"தோழியவர்","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"},{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"my friend, he"},{"surface":"சென்ற","parts":[{"text":"சென்ற","lemma":"cel","gloss":"that went"}],"gloss":"that went"},{"surface":"நாட்டே","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டே","lemma":"நாட்டே","gloss":"in the country itself"}],"gloss":"in the country itself","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Like the faded color of the water lily flower, / with folded wings, the house-dwelling sparrow, / having eaten the drying grain in the courtyard, of the public ground / inside the manure, scooping the fine dust, having played, / under the house eaves, in their resting place, with their chicks, dwells. / Sorrowful evening and loneliness, / is it today, my friend, in the country where he went?","translation":"Like a faded water lily, the house sparrow folds its wings. Having eaten the grain drying in the courtyard, it plays, scooping the fine dust of the manure in the public square, and then returns to rest with its chicks under the house eaves. My friend, does this sorrowful evening and its loneliness exist today in the land where he has gone?","modern":"ஆம்பல் பூவின் வாடிய நிறத்தைப் போன்ற குவிந்த இறக்கைகளை உடைய, வீட்டில் வாழும் குருவி, முற்றத்தில் காயும் தானியங்களை உண்டு, பொதுமன்றத்து எருவிலுள்ள நுண்துகளைக் குடைந்து விளையாடிவிட்டு, வீட்டின் கூரையின்கீழ் உள்ள தன் தங்குமிடத்தில் குஞ்சுகளோடு தங்கும். தோழியே! இத்தகைய துன்பம் தரும் மாலையும் தனிமையும் அவர் சென்ற நாட்டிலும் இன்று இருக்குமோ?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend during the evening, a time when her loneliness becomes unbearable. She observes a house sparrow returning to its nest under the eaves to rest with its family after a day of feeding and playing. This sight of domestic togetherness contrasts sharply with her own solitude. The sparrow's folded wings are compared to a faded water lily, evoking a sense of exhaustion and sadness. She wonders if this painful evening hour, which brings such longing to her, also affects her lover in the distant land where he has gone to earn wealth.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.47],[0.47,0.82],[0.82,1.17],[1.17,1.6],[1.6,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,4.97],[4.97,5.8],[5.8,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,7.49],[7.49,7.93],[7.93,8.81],[8.81,9.7],[9.7,10.44],[10.44,11.33],[11.33,12.07],[12.07,12.4],[12.4,13.7],[13.7,14.2],[14.2,15.15],[15.15,15.71],[15.71,16.27],[16.27,16.6],[16.6,17.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.47],[0.47,0.82],[0.82,1.17],[1.17,1.7],[1.7,2.2],[2.2,3.7],[3.7,3.9],[3.9,4.71],[4.71,5.8],[5.8,6.1],[6.1,6.6],[6.6,6.9],[6.9,7.79],[7.79,8.23],[8.23,9.11],[9.11,10.0],[10.0,10.23],[10.23,10.92],[10.92,12.45],[12.45,12.8],[12.8,14.4],[14.4,14.9],[14.9,15.9],[15.9,16.55],[16.55,17.21],[17.21,17.6],[17.6,18.3]]},"sync":[[["ஆம்பல்","water lily"]],[["பூவின்","of the flower"]],[["சாம்பல்","faded color"]],[["சாம்பல்","faded color"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["கூம்பிய","folded"]],[["சிறகர்","wings"]],[["மனையுறை","house-dwelling"]],[["குரீஇ","sparrow"]],[["முன்றில்","in the courtyard"]],[["உணங்கல்","drying grain"]],[["மாந்தி","having eaten"]],[["மன்றத்து","of the public ground"]],[["எருவினுண்","inside the manure"]],[["தாது","fine dust"]],[["குடைவன","scooping"]],[["ஆடி","having played"]],[["இல்லிறைப்","under the house eaves"]],[["பள்ளித்தம்","their resting place"]],[["பிள்ளையொடு","with their chicks"]],[["வதியும்","dwells"]],[["புன்கண்","sorrowful"]],[["மாலையும்","and the evening"]],[["புலம்பும்","and the loneliness"]],[["இன்றுகொல்","is it today?"]],[["தோழியவர்","my friend, he"]